This '''species''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that existed in [[the galaxy]]. The bipedal [[humanoid]] sentient species was distinguished by their enlarged craniums, purple skin, and white markings on their faces.<ref name="BOBF1" /> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="9 ABY Date">{{BoBFDate}}</ref> at least two other purple members of the species frequented [[Garsa Fwip's Sanctuary]] in [[Mos Espa]] on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]],<ref name="BOBF1" /> with one of them being present when [[Destruction of Garsa Fwip's Sanctuary|Sanctuary was blown up]] by the [[Pyke Syndicate]].<ref name="BOBF6">{{BOBF|Chapter 6: From the Desert Comes a Stranger}}</ref>

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
This species first appeared in the [[Chapter 1: Stranger in a Strange Land|first episode]] of the television series, ''[[Star Wars: The Book of Boba Fett]],'' written by [[Jon Favreau]] and directed by [[Robert Rodriguez]].<ref name="BOBF1" /> The species shared many traits with [[Unidentified enlarged-cranium blue species|another species]] created for the [[Chapter 9: The Marshal|first episode]] of the [[The Mandalorian Season Two|second season]] of the television series, ''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian]],''<ref name="Mando9">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 9: The Marshal}}</ref> even possessing ears like that species' concept art while the actual species was earless.<ref name="Gallery">{{DisneyGallery|Disney Gallery: The Mandalorian: Making of Season Two|Making of Season Two}}</ref>

